and Amadio capitalized on a 3-on-2 break.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4565255/shane-pinto\">Shane Pinto</a> also scored for the Senators, tying the game at 1 at 11:33 of the second period.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://x.com/sabresplays/status/2118163851053084676?a=yFatj-hwagfQqEisf1E&s=46\"><a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4565238/peyton-krebs\">Peyton Krebs</a> scored at the 14-minute mark</a> of the first to give the Sabres the lead. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4024988/tage-thompson\">Tage Thompson</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5149186/zach-benson\">Zach Benson</a> assisted on Krebs' first goal of the season.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4587815/samuel-ersson\">Samuel Ersson</a> made 24 saves in the win for the Senators, who entered the game having lost three of their last four games, including a 6-3 setback against Anaheim on Sunday.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4736758/colten-ellis\">Colten Ellis</a> had 28 saves for the Sabres, who had their three-game win streak halted.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Senators: Host the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/utah/utah-mammoth\">Utah Mammoth</a> on Saturday in the opener of a three-game homestand.\n\n\r\n              Sabres: Host the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/cbj/columbus-blue-jackets\">Columbus Blue Jackets</a> on Friday in the second game of a four-game homestand.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              The Associated Press created this story using technology provided by <a href=\"https://www.dataskrive.com/\">Data Skrive</a> and data from <a href=\"https://www.sportradar.com/\">Sportradar</a>.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              \r\n                <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/nhl\">See AP’s full NHL coverage here</a>","published":"2026-11-05T03:27:34Z"}}